{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-sql#feature-1","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-sql","commit":"67d695f393598b625f0808f5742285017fa3650d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sql 的功能「只读 SQL 查询」：在指定数据库运行单条只读查询并返回列名和行数据。调用 sql_query，输入 SQL、可选连接名和 table/csv/json 格式；结果受行数上限约束，并标出是否截断。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:543-598"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-sql#feature-2","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-sql","commit":"67d695f393598b625f0808f5742285017fa3650d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sql 的功能「结构与统计」：可查看所有表或指定表的列信息，也可汇总表数量、各表行数和数据库体积。由 sql_schema 与 sql_stats 工具触发，输入连接名及可选表名。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:627-737","src/tools.ts:403-416"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-sql#feature-3","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-sql","commit":"67d695f393598b625f0808f5742285017fa3650d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sql 的功能「写入与 DDL」：通过 sql_exec 执行写 SQL 或数据库结构变更，可选择连接并提交多语句脚本；返回影响行数。只读配置会禁用该工具，默认写审批流程要求确认。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:600-625","src/index.ts:56-72"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-sql#feature-4","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-sql","commit":"67d695f393598b625f0808f5742285017fa3650d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sql 的功能「连接和健康检查」：sql_list 逐一测试配置连接并返回目标与连通状态；sql_health 汇总连接结果及只读、审批、行数上限和超时配置，便于定位连接问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:488-541","src/tools.ts:739-770"]}
{"unit_id":"STARDUSTLC666__dsh-sql#caveat-1","repo":"STARDUSTLC666/dsh-sql","commit":"67d695f393598b625f0808f5742285017fa3650d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sql 使用前须知：写操作默认需要宿主审批确认；启用 readOnly 后 sql_exec 会被禁用，实际可否写入还取决于数据库账号权限。（见 src/config.ts:94-96、src/index.ts:56-72）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/config.ts:94-96","src/index.ts:56-72"]}
